Package: ncr
Type: Package
Title: Exploratory Visualization and Slicing of NetCDF Files in Base R
Version: 0.5.3
Authors@R: person("Takeshi", "Enomoto", email = "takeshi.enomoto@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a thin, interactive GrADS- and NCL-inspired S3 wrapper
    around 'RNetCDF' and base R graphics ('fields' and 'maps') for rapid
    exploratory analysis and visualization of NetCDF files. Supports stateful
    and ad-hoc slicing across longitude, latitude, vertical level, and time,
    filled and line contours, self-scaling vector arrows, map projections,
    Hovmoeller diagrams with formatted time axes, and vertical cross-sections
    with dual pressure and height axes.
License: BSD_2_clause + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    RNetCDF,
    fields,
    maps,
    grDevices,
    graphics,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
